# Osteomancer Adept (CR 611.2a, 109.5): "you may cast creature spells from your graveyard" - "you" is the Adept's controller. Bot1 casts the Adept on
# turn 1. On turn 2 Bot2 casts Black Lotus, Faithless Looting (discarding two Spectral Sailors) and a Lightning Bolt at Bot1, leaving five cards in
# their graveyard, and a Mox Sapphire. On turn 3 the Adept taps, and once its ability has resolved Bot2, with the Sapphire untapped, holds priority
# at instant speed with a flash creature in their graveyard and plenty to forage: the Sailor is refused them - the way is Bot1's alone.

